"da-06":[null,"264 uses 24 mpg; the true rate is 240/8 = 30 mpg.","300 is the distance for 10 gallons, not 11.","352 uses 32 mpg — check the division."],
"da-07":[null,"0 assumes removing 15 leaves the median unchanged, but it shifts from 8 to 7.","2 would need the new median to be 6; the remaining middle value is 7.","8 is m itself, not the difference m − n."],
"da-08":[null,"$60 treats +40% then −20% as a net +20% — percents of different bases don't cancel.","$70 is the marked-up price BEFORE the discount.","$58 matches no correct step: the 20% comes off $70, giving $56."],
